[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（トレーナーさん曰く、摩美々が以前よりも本気で\r\nレッスンを受けるようになったらしい）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "005"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい傾向だな\r\n……っと、噂をすればだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110010,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "お疲れ様でーす",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030050010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……プロデューサー？\r\nどうかしたんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、レッスンを真面目にやってるみたいじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですかぁ？\r\n普通だと思いますケドー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（反応はいつも通りか\r\nでも、トレーナーさんが言うことは本当なんだろうな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ、摩美々",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頑張ってるご褒美に\r\nなにかして欲しいことでもあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "別にー、なんにもいらないですよー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110040",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……プロデューサーには\r\nいつも色々もらってますしー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　いま何か言ったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "いえいえー大したこと言ってないですー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110060",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、近くにいるだけで面白いからぁ\r\n何もしなくても平気って、言っただけですー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、ほめてるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "当たり前じゃないですかぁ、ふふー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よくわからないが、摩美々の機嫌もよさそうだし\r\nまぁ、いいか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ご褒美といえばー、\r\nもうプロデューサーから貰ったんでしたー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんのことだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "実はさっきー冷蔵庫に入ってたプリン\r\n半分くらい食べちゃったんですよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "010",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0118",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ってあれ？　プリンはそのままだぞ？）",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "食べられた形跡なし、ですねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030050010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、だましたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー、ただの冗談ですよー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "でも、そんなに焦るなら\r\n本当に食べておけばよかったですねー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まったく……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサー\r\nこれからは気を付けないといけませんねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なにをだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "私が、いつプロデューサーのプリン\r\n食べちゃうか、わかりませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "からかうのはやめろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー\r\nどうしようかなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、そもそも人の物を黙って勝手に食べるのは\r\nよくないことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "じゃあー、先に言えば\r\n食べてもいいってことですかぁ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "屁理屈を言うんじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー、ふふふー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まったく、楽しそうに笑って\r\nいつまでたってもイタズラ好きだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "はい、なんといっても悪い子ですからねー\r\nだからぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005003110200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "これからもずーっと、\r\nまみみのこと見張ってて下さいねー、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500311/2005003110200"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]